
% Crash and Burn

vamp: I |
a: I | V | vi | IV |
link: I | V | vi | IV |
In: $vamp $a*2
Vr: $a*2
instr: $a*2
b: vi | IV | V |
b_cad: vi | . bVII . . | . IV . . |
PCh: $b $b_cad
c: I | V | IV |
c_cad: I | vi | V |
cc: $c $c_cad
bridge: $c $c_cad
Ch: $cc*2
PostCh: $cc*2
fadeout: $cc*2
S: [E] $In $Vr*2 $PCh $Ch $link $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge $instr $Vr $Ch*2 $PostCh $fadeout
